        "heading": "Who are Magellan Federal’s largest buyers in FY2026 to date?",
        "body": "The General Services Administration obligated $189M. The Department of the Interior obligated $45.8M and the Department of Defense obligated $29.8M. Other buyers include the Department of Health and Human Services at $20.5M and the Department of Transportation at $1.5M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What services and markets drive Magellan Federal’s FY2026 obligations?",
        "body": "Other Individual and Family Services is the largest market at $215M. Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services follows at $52.7M, with Human Resources Consulting Services at $11.4M and Engineering Services at $6.4M. Smaller markets include Offices of Mental Health Practitioners (except Physicians) at $638K and Professional and Management Development Training at $16K."
      }
